    {
      "text": "why does 50 tabs make your laptop lag?\n\nRAM fills up, so your computer starts parking stuff on the SSD (swap). the SSD is way slower than RAM.\n\nclose tabs = free RAM. restart = clear RAM.",
      "sentAt": "2026-11-21T11:15:14.411Z",
      "hoursLive": 132,
      "views": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
