      "engagement": 0,
      "engagementRate": 0,
      "early": false,
      "score": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "a good website doesn't know your password.\n\nit stores a hash: a one-way scramble of it. when you log in, it scrambles what you typed and checks if they match.\n\nif a site can email you your actual password, that's a red flag.",
      "sentAt": "2026-11-19T02:30:11.051Z",
